      "properties": {},
      "widgets_values": [
        "## SweepKit quick start\n\nSweeps **seed (1, 2, 3) × cfg (4, 7, 10)**: 9 images plus one 3×3 grid, saved under `output/SweepKit_quickstart/`.\n\n1. Pick your checkpoint in **Load Checkpoint**.\n2. Edit the prompts on **Sweep All-in-One**. Add `{}` placeholders and `text`-type Sweep Dimensions to sweep prompt text too.\n3. Queue.\n\nSee NODE_GUIDE.md, workflow 1."
      ],
      "color": "#432",
      "bgcolor": "#653"
    },
